    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d191-a1">

                <pb facs="0383" n="1343" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1343"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fairchild to Mr.
                            Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Treasury Department</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1888-05-28"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            28, 1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the letter of the Acting
                    Secretary dated the 15th instant, in regard to the steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Prins Maurits</hi>, I have the honor to inclose herewith
                    a communication from the Commissioner of Navigation of this date, furnishing the
                    information requested by your Department upon the subject of the above-named
                    vessel.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. S. Fairchild.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
